== Walkthrough ==

Indaria is located in the Office of the People behind the bank at loc (312, -488), South Qeynos.

You say, 'Hail, Indaria.' 

: Indaria says 'Hello, have you seen my daughter?'

That is all Indaria has to say until you give her [[A Doll]] looted off a shark in the Qeynos Aqueducts or near the South Qeynos docks or in Erudin harbor or near the Freeport Harbor. Hand her a doll:

: Indaria tries to keep her composure. She hands you a silver locket with great effort and then bursts into tears.

You get experience, coin, and a [[Velvet Choker]]. 


